      "byline": "A thorough look at Class 6's polling and what the numbers show.",
      "bodyHtml": "<b>This article is transferred from a Reddit Post.</b><div><b><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/thespinroom/comments/1vasya3/class_6_polling_analysis_broad_prediction/\">https://www.reddit.com/r/thespinroom/comments/1vasya3/class_6_polling_analysis_broad_prediction/</a><br></b></div><div><img src=\"https://i.redd.it/ti10y3nq4dgh1.png\" alt=\"rich text editor image\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" data-media-id=\"ti10y3nq4dgh1\" data-mimetype=\"image/png\"></div><div><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">With our Class 6 Mod campaign just about done, I decided to take a look at the polls we have right now(along with lots of historical context) and what they might say about the outcome of the election. Let’s dive in.</span></p><h1 class=\"text-24 leading-7 mt-large mb-x6\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Is More Always Better?&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h1><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">In regards to polling, the usual answer is yes, and this holds up in TSR as well, in </span><i><em class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">certain</em></i><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> cases at the very least.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Travelling back in time 10 months takes us to the September 2025 Class 1 Mod Election, where incumbent mod Impressive_Plant won in a landslide against two challengers. That election had six polls published over the course of the whole campaign, with varying sample sizes. The top half in regards to sample size had wildly varying results, one putting Plant at slightly over 70% in the first round, while Plant’s own internal(albeit conducted earlier than declarations) had him losing by over 20% in the first round.</span></p><table class=\"relative table-fixed\"><colgroup><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Date / Type</strong></b></p></th><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pollster</strong></b></p></th><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sample Size</strong></b></p></th><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Impressive_Plant4418</strong></b></p></th><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">HighKingFloof</strong></b></p></th><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><strong style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Disguised_VW_Beetle</strong></b></p></th><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-ne