\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">29.63%</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">14.81%</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">—</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Impressive_Plant +25.93%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">23 September</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">EggPolls</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">24</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">70.83%</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">20.83%</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">8.34%</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">—</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Impressive_Plant +50%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">14 September</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Impressive_Plant4418</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">22</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">31.82%</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">54.54% </span><i><em class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">(TSP Nominee)</em></i></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">—</span></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">13.64% </span><i><em class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">(Undecided)</em></i></p></td><td class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top;\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">HighKingFloof +22.73%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The concurrent Class 5 Election showed a different picture, though. gunsmokexeon was the favourite to win the election, according to polls at least. They showed different levels of support but ultimately overstated smaller candidates and missed the actual first round margin from as </span><i><em class=\"italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">few</em></i><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> as 8% to as many as 34%. gunsmoke lost the election to Forsaken_Wedding by a single vote with a first round margin of Forsaken +3.03.</span></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The most accurate poll this election was the one that collected data last.</span></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ever since then, polling has evolved and shifted, missing some elections and getting others more or less correct.</span></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">With this in mind, I believe the most accurate poll is the one with a right mix of the closest sample size to actual turnout and proximity to election day. Mind you, that actual turnout has been declining from the highs of some 35 votes last year to just 16 one month ago. That sometimes ends up in the poll having more responses than the election.</span></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">To answer my original question, more isn’t always better. If you want to gauge how voters feel, poll the closest amount possible to actual turnout.</span></p><h1 class=\"text-24 leading-7 mt-large mb-x6\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">What This Means for Class 6</span></h1><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Class 6 has four polls with public results as of now, all available here and in the spreadsheet below:</span></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><a href=\"https://thespinroom.miraheze.org/wiki/July_2026_Class_6_Mod_Election#Polling\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">https://thespinroom.miraheze.org/wiki/July_2026_Class_6_Mod_Election#Polling</span></a></p><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The ones with a higher sample size show Nazibol leading the race with a narrow margin against incumbent moderator wiptes, however, there’s plenty of reason to believe that it simply won’t push them over the line.</span></p><table class=\"relative table-fixed\"><colgroup><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"px-sm py-xs leading-5 border-sm border-solid border-neutral-border relative\" style=\"border: 1px solid black; width: 75px; vertical-align: top; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(242, 243, 245);\"><p class=\"first:mt-0 last:mb-0\"><b><str